# Maintainer development

Requires Python 3.11+ and uv. Run from the package directory:

```sh
./dev.sh develop --local
./dev.sh check
./dev.sh test
./dev.sh build
```

Use `dev.ps1` on Windows. Add behavioral tests before releasing. After changing
metadata or development dependencies, run `./dev.sh lock --local` and review the
lock. Without sibling sources, omit `--local` and optionally pass
`--wheelhouse /path/to/wheels`. Build outputs go to `dist/`.

See the repository [release guide](../../docs/releases.md). Generation does not
register this package for release. External contributions are not currently accepted;
see [reporting guidance](../../docs/reporting.md).
